*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.cer
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets/
credentials/

# Watermark receipts (sensitive key material)
receipts/
**/*receipt*.md
**/*receipt*.json
**/*reciept*.md
**/*reciept*.json

# Project binaries (defense-in-depth; primary outputs are already under bin/)
shadowforge
shadowforge-api

# Database files
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Archive files (test artifacts)
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tar.bz2
*.7z
!testdata/**/*.zip
!testdata/**/*.tar
!testdata/**/*.tar.gz

